OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry with warm sunny spells for
OL,6,Fmost, although isolated light showers
OL,7,Fare possible during the morning. Winds
OL,8,Fpicking up in the afternoon, before
OL,9,Feasing by the evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FSkies will clear overnight
OL,12,Fwith light winds, allowing
OL,13,Ftemperatures to fall and the chance of
OL,14,Fmist or of patches forming around dawn.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FMorning mist and fog patches
OL,17,Fwill quickly clear to give a bright
OL,18,Fmorning before turning cloudy in the
OL,19,Fafternoon with a band of rain arriving
OL,20,Ffrom the west overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
